      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "b. The following City agencies and divisions of the Office of the Mayor shall participate in the Advisory Board: The Department of Finance, the Human Resources Administration, the Department for the Aging, the Mayor's Office for People with Disabilities, the Mayor's Community Assistance Unit, and the Mayor's Offices of Constituency Affairs. The New York City Housing Authority shall also be requested to participate in the Advisory Board.",
